  "rationale": "The plan prioritizes fixing the most glaring cultural and geometric inaccuracies (pattern, collar, obi) first, as these are the primary failures of the current draft, while simultaneously addressing the visual hierarchy to ensure the refined craft is actually perceived by the viewer."
